<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/9/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended by substituting paragraph (b) with the following; \"(b) by any person or corporation for any purpose which in the opinion of the State Authority is beneficial to the economic development of Malaysia or any part thereof or to the public generally or any class of the public; or\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/9/eng@> .
