<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/9/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/name> "The principal Act is amended by inserting,"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/9/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "immediately after section 68, the following new section 68A: \"Subsequent 68A. Where any land has been acquired under disposal, this Act, whether before or after etc., of acquired commencement of this section, no subsequent land not to disposal or use of, or dealing with, the land, invalidate whether by the State Authority or by the acquisition. Government, person or corporation on whose behalf the land was acquired, shall invalidate the acquisition of the land.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/9/eng@> .
